# SAMANVAY — Seat 5 · deployment.
#
# Without this file the build context is ~700 MB (.venv 405M, runs/ 259M, fixtures/ 31M)
# and every byte is tarred and shipped to the daemon before the first instruction runs —
# even though the Dockerfile COPYs none of it. Measured on the authoring machine.
#
# Keep this in sync with the named COPY list in the Dockerfile: the Dockerfile decides
# what goes IN, this file decides what never leaves the disk.

# A host-specific virtualenv. The image builds its own at /opt/venv; copying this one in
# would ship macOS/arm64 wheels into a linux image.
.venv/
venv/

# Outputs and caches — regenerated by `make fixture` / `make demo` inside the container.
runs/
.cache/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Test data. Tens of MB of GeoTIFF, supplied by the bind mount at run time.
fixtures/
data/

# Repository metadata, not application input. .github/ is deliberately NOT ignored:
# tests/test_deploy.py reads .github/workflows/ci.yml, and the `test` compose service
# runs that suite. It is a few KB.
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
